<title>POLAND: POLISH PEPEES PUBLIC OFFERING MIN PRICE AT PLN 100.</title>
<headline>POLISH PEPEES PUBLIC OFFERING MIN PRICE AT PLN 100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Food producer PEPEES SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Minimum price set at (PLN):	 100</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 152,100</p>
<p> Subscription period		   May 12-16</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		1.17 mln</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			change the firm's ownership</p>
<p>					     structure</p>
<p>Lead manager: Pomorski Bank Kredytowy brokerage</p>
<p> Earnings Data (mln PLN)  Jan-Feb 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net profit:		  3.9			8.9</p>
<p> Pre-tax			3.9		     14.7</p>
<p> Sales:			18.1		    127.5</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p>National Investment Fund (NFI) No. 3 - 33 pct of shares</p>
<p>State treasury - 10.44 pct of shares</p>
<p>NOTE: The shares will be allotted at a special bourse session</p>
<p>on May 19.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
